s. It constantly mixes its poisonous gases.",[16]="Top-grade perfume is made using its internal poison gases by diluting them to the highest level.",[17]="It grows by feeding on gases released by garbage. Though very rare, triplets have been found.",[18]="It grows by feeding on gases released by garbage. Though very rare, triplets have been found.",[21]="Inhaling toxic fumes from trash and mixing them inside its body lets it spread an even fouler stench.",[22]="Inhaling toxic fumes from trash and mixing them inside its body lets it spread an even fouler stench.",[23]="If one of the twin Koffing inflates, the other one deflates. It constantly mixes its poisonous gases.",[24]="Very rarely, a sudden mutation can result in two small Koffing twins becoming conjoined as a Weezing.",[25]="Weezing loves the gases given off by rotted kitchen garbage. This Pokémon will find a dirty, unkempt house and make it its home. At night, when the people in the house are asleep, it will go through the trash.",[26]="Weezing alternately shrinks and inflates its twin bodies to mix together toxic gases inside. The more the gases are mixed, the more powerful the toxins become. The Pokémon also becomes more putrid.",[31]="This Pokémon lives and grows by absorbing poison gas, dust, and germs that exist inside garbage.",[32]="This Pokémon lives and grows by absorbing poison gas, dust, and germs that exist inside garbage.",[33]="It mixes gases between its two bodies. It’s said that these Pokémon were seen all over the Galar region back in the day.",[34]="It can’t suck in air quite as well as a Galarian Weezing, but the toxins it creates are more potent than those of its counterpart."},es={[23]="Si uno de los gemelos Koffing se infla, el otro se desinfla. Mezclan constantemente sus venenosos gases.",[24]="En raras ocasiones, se produce una mutación y dos pequeños Koffing se unen formando un Weezing.",[25]="A Weezing le encantan los gases que emanan de los desperdicios que quedan en la cocina. Est